--- a/Inference_pytorch/NeuroSIM/Param.cpp
+++ b/Inference_pytorch/NeuroSIM/Param.cpp
@@
- novelMapping = true;        // false: conventional mapping
+ novelMapping = false;       // false: conventional mapping

Reason: the platform maps signed activation/weight branches as a general expanded
matrix, including LeNet-5 5x5 kernels and fully-connected layers. Conventional
mapping is the applicable general mapping path. The upstream default novel mapping
exits during chip initialization on this Windows MinGW build, including for the
upstream VGG8 network, before any weight/input trace is read.
